        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Zianmei Kaipouc, ata gaeklou khang ney e,",
            "Nang pamv khou duplou khang ai ’zwan guang e,",
            "Poubauhmei paan hamhna ai lungc ngam mak ge,",
            "Zauzianlouna ata bam ’duanghlou o.",
            "",
            "",
            "Kaganv kathuic ata bam ’duanghlou o,",
            "’Thiammei ta ai ping e, bam ’duanghlou o,",
            "Tingneih sii khou, gay khou bam ’duanghlou o,",
            "Ringh khou, theih khou ata bam ’duanghlou o.",
            "",
            "2 Zauczihmei guay $%6 ata dinghaengv pwkhou,",
            "Kamuatcmei duipui khou ai tat pwkhou,",
            "Apumtan, alung, machunc ’suan key pwkhou,",
            "Zauczianlouna ata bam ’duanghlou o.",
            "",
            "3 Achaenglwan khou neihriw souclou bam khou hei,",
            "’Chamlou, zaylou, gaekloumei swlou o;",
            "Ryanra lakna lungh zinghmei padik pwkhou,",
            "Zauzianlouna ata bam ’duanghlou o.",
            "",
            "4 Ai thay makmei, zinghmei duibaek ’naa pwkhou,",
            "Kauh lev dih khou gu ngammei thow nai cho?",
            "Gaeklou khang ngammei hei Kaipouc, Nang na de;",
            "Zauzianlouna ata bam ’duanghlou o."
          ]
        }
      },
